rk:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SKILL.md 由 YAML frontmatter（元数据）和 Markdown body（执行指令）两部分组成。</li>\n<li>Frontmatter 定义技能的身份信息：名称、版本、触发词、依赖工具、优先级。</li>\n<li>Body 按照 Purpose → Trigger Patterns → Usage → Implementation → Safety → Testing 的固定结构组织。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>gray-matter</code> + <code>zod</code> 实现类型安全的解析和校验。</li>\n<li>每个技能目录下放置一个 SKILL.md 文件，Agent 在启动时递归扫描并加载。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SKILL.md 格式定义","id":"skill-md-格式定义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 SKILL.md","id":"什么是-skill-md"},{"level":2,"text":"Frontmatter 字段规范","id":"frontmatter-字段规范"},{"level":2,"text":"Markdown Body 结构","id":"markdown-body-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"完整示例：web-search 技能","id":"完整示例-web-search-技能"},{"level":2,"text":"完整示例：file-manager 技能","id":"完整示例-file-manager-技能"},{"level":2,"text":"Frontmatter 解析实现","id":"frontmatter-解析实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多步工具调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/function-calling/multi-step-tools"},"next":{"title":"Skill 加载与发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/skill-system/skill-loader"}}